      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FOR MERCY SAKE (2) drew an outside box and was game in defeat when only a nose from the winner Aston Barbie in second(28.01) at this track. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Rates highly and will give a great sight. MIGHTY ALAN (1) failed to feature last start after being shuffled back early at this track, but prior to that won comfortably by 4.5 lengths at this track (23.61) beating Steely Dawn in a Grade 5 on August 17. Cannot be left out. MERRY MERRIWA (7) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing sixth (23.94) in a Grade 5 at this track. Form at the trip sound including four wins. Should be thereabouts. BURNSIDE BAMBI (4) form at this distance reads well.",
